    {
        "text": "We're in the clear!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "You okay, Big Bob\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? That wound on your leg...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_008"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are some stragglers over there! They're probably from the Valk Vanguards!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can handle this on my own! Go after the ones who are fleeing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "This kid...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, hey, why are you giving me that look?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "G-get away from me or I'll put a hole through you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
