        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "You took care of them all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Impressive. This kid's got talent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay there and don't move. I'll patch you up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine, I can take care of myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No means no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw it, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw the crystalization on my body, right? Are you trying to get yourself infected?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our mission at Rhodes Island is to help all the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island? Aren't you from Victoria...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Former Victoria Mounted Police. Now, I'm a Rhodes Island operator!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay back, lass. I'm an Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Carol, this might get a bit messy. You should step back a bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "All right, I stopped the bleeding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You do this a lot, huh? For the Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not afraid of me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A lot of my coworkers are already Infected, but I can't tell who is and who isn't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, it's sometimes hard to tell until it's time to hit the showers, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, shorty. You're naive, but you're a good person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
